{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47698","headline":"庵壁题诗 · 许宣平","name":"庵壁题诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐居三十载，石室南山巅。\n静夜翫明月，清朝饮碧泉。\n樵人歌壠上，谷鸟戏岩前。\n乐矣不知老，都忘甲子年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许宣平","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}